    "detailed_description": "Minimalistic puzzle game. Connect the opposite sides of the same color by rotating the tiles. Each level is randomly generated, but guaranteed to be solvable.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2>You are challenged to bring order into the jumbled mix of lines and curves by connecting the opposite sides of the same color. Clicking a tile in the grid rotates the lines and curves in it. Colors will follow the lines.<br><br><br>You may need to find spots to cross the lines or build loops.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's random!</h2>Each level is randomly generated, so solving even a small grid can vary wildly between being quite straight-forward to being a real challenge!<br><br>Only one thing is for sure: there is at least one solution for ALL of the shown levels. That's a promise!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple grid sizes and numbers of lines to connect<br></li><li>Share levels solved or as a challenge with your friends<br></li><li><strong>Endless random levels await being solved</strong></li></ul>",
